Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 这个娜奥米自从救你出炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this "Naomi" has been controlling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直在控制你\N{\fnArial\fs30}since she got you out of purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是善心大发\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just want to guide me out of purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想带我离开炼狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the goodness of your undead heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭个顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hopping a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个人类传送门 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a human portal, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅限人类通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only humans can pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了他我才站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's also the reason I'm topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在下面身不由己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you had to do what you had to down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经出来了 本尼却还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're out now, and Benny's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记你为我做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've done for me I will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}God built a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你都完成了 就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you've done all three, you can slam the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我没能通过测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I didn't pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我通过了 剩下的都让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did. And I'm doing the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得悠着点 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to slow down. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要干掉地狱 那样我才能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said nuking hell … that's how I get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我才能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想结束这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need this to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在鼓捣什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're up to…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟温家兄弟合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}working with them, those Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通的 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead end, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你脑子里 我无所不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in your head, as well as everywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次惹怒了我 丢了根指头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you irked me, you lost a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这次会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what will happen this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第19集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.06,0:01:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 怎么回事 为什么发求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez. What's going on? What's with the S.O.S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.64,0:02:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 你的抗焦虑药得加量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it means we need to up your anxiety meds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 那是你的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, you're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克劳力知道你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Crowley knew where you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会只折腾你的脑子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd do a hell of a lot more than mess with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖思呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where's Garth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去干活儿或者看牙医了 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a case or … or the dentist. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你在电话上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, what did you want to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不肯说的是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you couldn't say on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.74,0:02:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把煎锅放下行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you put the frying pan down, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我译出了石碑上第二道测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I translated the second trial from the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个疯狂的先知 干得好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…crazy prophet, you. Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克劳力能进入我脑子 他也知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Crowley's in my head, he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他绝对没有进入你的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's definitely not in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在你脑子里 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in your head, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你压力很大 先跟我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're distressed. Just stay with us, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二道测试是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the second trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地狱拯救一个无辜的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}An innocent soul has to be rescued from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将它送入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and delivered unto heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「送入」 上帝就这么措辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unto." That's … that's how God talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救地狱里的灵魂 要下地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue a soul from hell? Like actually…go to hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么将灵魂送入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How … how do you get a soul unto heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.53,0:03:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么将灵魂弄出地狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do you even get a soul out of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要找个专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个性感的小妞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the hot chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再来一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how about another owie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我们要怎么偷偷下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, wouldn't it be a lot easier just to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to enter hell, uh, uninvited?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保证不说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We promise we won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.53,0:04:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是禁忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's forbidden, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要价钱合适 你们都能偷渡进入地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a price, y'all can be smuggled across hell's border.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找谁 - 野死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By who? - Rogue reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有进出的秘密方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got secret ways, in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是地狱 膈幕 天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just hell … the veil, heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,野死神偷渡人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue reapers smuggling people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人 灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他们是地狱的蛇头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? They're like hell coyotes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now kill me. Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:04:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了也比被克劳力收拾强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better death than Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得先告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first you're gonna tell us…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ajay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to talk to you for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来谈生意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to do business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们是凡人 血肉之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are mortal … flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们想穿越地狱之界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we wanted to cross the border into hell …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitor's pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人想进地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wants to get into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这样的蛇头能帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But could a coyote like you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有特别的技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have special skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的费用可不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have overhead. It will be pricy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How pricey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 你们会欠我一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, you will owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的好像你认识我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like you know us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你们是温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. You're the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.13,0:06:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Have we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是把鲍比·辛格带入地狱的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the reaper who took Bobby Singer to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby in hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们烧了他的骨头 那样就都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We burned his bones. Once we did that, it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有然后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 鲍比是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, 'cause, see, Bobby was on the good side of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人是要上阁楼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and good guys go to the penthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你认识谁 谁来处理你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on who you know, what palms get greased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你上了地狱之王的黑名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're on the king of hell's no-fly list,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别想上天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no way you cruise the friendly skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,两张下行票和三张上行票是多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much for two tickets down and three back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到他的话了 鲍比在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the guy … Bobby's in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna spring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们谈过了 迪恩 我得独自完成测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gone over this, Dean. I have to do the trials solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是鲍比啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bobby we're talking about, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说实话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's face it …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近状态并不算很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have not exactly been up to full speed lately, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有这个机会 我们不能有失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one shot at this. We can't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有失误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他带回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么个运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does this…work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他整整一天后就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back in exactly 24 hours time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以到时来找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return for him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it gets creepier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. This is purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这是炼狱是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean this is purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的不是这个 我要去的是地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't what I paid for. I booked the hell tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特 别激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, Winchester, detach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里离地狱很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hell-adjacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路我走了很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been down this highway many times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着小溪 走到三棵树融为一体的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the stream to where three trees meet as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they meet, there are rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头之间是道传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the rocks is the portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}A portal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入地狱的后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}A back door to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me … it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你不跟我一起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So you're not coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一个凡人偷渡过来就够冒险的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smuggling a mortal across the border is risky enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一个温家兄弟带进地狱 可得要命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But gate-crashing a Winchester into hell seriously blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我整一天之后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'll be back in 24 hours, precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你幸好带了那个来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing you brought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可不好混\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not an easy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Kev, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得柜子是最安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the closet would be safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他钻进了我的脑子 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in my head, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 他就知道我的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's in my head, he knows where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we … we should move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你冷静点好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez, Kev, would you chill out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别现在发疯啊 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Don't lose it on me now, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都结束了告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me when this all ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想听到那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that's the only thing I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前说过了 这是不会结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, like I told you before, this isn't going to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 其他人的生活很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, other guys, they got it easy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后院烧烤 参加保龄球队\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all backyard barbecues and…bowling teams,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们要额外承担一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you and me? We got to carry a little extra weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承担不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这一切都很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this whole thing sucks. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you suck it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且扛过去 我们就得这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you push through because that's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你接受了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you get on board with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会好过多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ride is a lot smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.25,0:11:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要薯条吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}French fry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去屋里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna … I'm gonna be in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天情况转好再告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know when there's a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Ajay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很久没聊天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while since we chatted …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,加了凤尾鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra anchovies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事想跟我说说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you want to get off your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}An update?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许记得 我这人耐性不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you may recall, patience isn't one of my virtues.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我这人总体来说不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't have any virtues, but if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就算我有优点也不会是有耐性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain that patience wouldn't be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你真的没什么想说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, sure there's nothing weighing on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:13:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 跟温家兄弟做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, say, about making a deal with the Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我知道那种事做不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I know better than to attempt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的探子看见你跟萨姆·温彻斯特一起离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}My operative saw you leaving with Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, that's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}A possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在考验我本来就没有的耐性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying my non-patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我只是在做自己的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I was just doing what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,您也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you are more than aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.27,0:13:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时候 会兼职做点小生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do occasionally … moonlight as a freelancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能跟他们做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not freelance with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Sam want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我现在想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, actually, it's, uh, starting to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像想进地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have wanted to get into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地狱 他为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hell? Why would he want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 干我这行 我不多问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear. My job … I don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么温彻斯特先生什么时候从地狱回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what time is Mr. Winchester due back from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接他的时间是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm picking him up in…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,17小时之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, now 17 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟辛苦费你别想收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one fare you won't be collecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个兔子洞 真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rabbit hole. This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddy? Eddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddy? Eddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在为此祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been praying for it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是他 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not…him. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在为此祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been praying for it. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了 我就知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came. I knew you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在为此祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been praying for it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.71,0:18:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚出去 你个黑眼混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here, you black-eyed son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 鲍比 我是萨姆啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Bobby, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是猫王呢 给我走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I'm Elvis. Move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby - - Get!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 如果不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, damn it. If it's not Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么知道你和托瑞·斯培林（美国女演员）的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do I know all about you and Tori Spelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你粉她 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fan. Yeah. Or … or, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你在美国商城免费修脚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What about your free pedicure at the Mall of America?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逼迪恩永远不许告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made Dean swear to never tell another living soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事对你人生的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}how it changed your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:18:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你之前都来过两百个萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're the 200th Sam I've seen today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就这么折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how they screw with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有各种黑眼的萨姆和迪恩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just endless Sams and Deans all wearing the same black eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我是我想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't tell me it's what I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.40,0:19:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 鲍比 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Bobby, I'm good. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该待在这儿 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't belong here, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're getting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道只有我一人理解情况有多紧急吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one who sees the urgency of this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.95,0:19:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 这里面绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir - - Something is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地狱之犬被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hellhound has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大号温彻斯特想要闯进我的母舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester jumbo size is trying to break into the mother ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们那个先知在疯狂地翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that prophet of theirs is madly translating away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己算算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪来的 临时雇员中介吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did we get you, huh? Temp agency?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要凯文·谭和他那半的石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need Kevin Tran, and I need his half of the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然好东西都在他那半上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, his half has the good stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我那半只有致谢和作者简介\N{\fnArial\fs30}where mine has the acknowledgements and "about the author."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是最好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.80,0:20:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吃点鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in here and grab some of these eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 你不能永远躲在里面啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev! Come on, man. You can't hide in there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是正怕着呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to being scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我先采取了行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I made a preemptive move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made a what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能捧着块石碑坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sit here with the tablet like a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个活靶子被克劳力死死盯着\N{\fnArial\fs30}sitting duck and Crowley breathing down my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把石碑丢掉能减轻点压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting rid of the tablet just takes off some of the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 丢掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Getting rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是暂时的 我藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporarily. I hid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:20:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 藏哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是告诉你藏哪了就不叫藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tell you where, it's not hidden, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 告诉我石碑藏哪了 否则我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, tell me where the damn tablet is, or I swear to you …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.23,0:21:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能怎么样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子啊 小时候真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids. So cute when they're little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一变成青少年就烦人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they turn into teenagers, and the party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没正式见过 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't been formally introduced, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道小卡离开炼狱后你对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what you did to Cass after he got out of purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我把他救出了炼狱之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I rescued him from purgatory, you mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且为此牺牲了好几个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the cost of many angels' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你折腾他的脑子 让他监视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screwed with his head and had him spy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确跟卡西迪奥谈过很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is true that I have spoken with Castiel many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那是想接触他 帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to reach out to him, trying to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你肯定注意到了炼狱对他的改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you must have noticed how purgatory changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过去也曾不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's been unstable in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:22:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对他现在的伤还是很震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was shocked at how damaged he is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别想把这事洗白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, okay? Don't … don't try to spin this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道你让他杀我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't know that you told him to try and kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在他听来就是那个意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose that is how he would hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得知天使石碑时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I learned of the angel tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确让卡西迪奥不惜任何代价得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did tell Castiel to get it at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的工作 保护天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my job … to protect heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样 是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a warrior, just as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我该怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.22,0:22:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在卡西迪奥不知去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Castiel is in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,兜里还揣着个氢弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a hydrogen bomb in his pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕我们都会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I … I'm scared, for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.35,0:22:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任天使 所以我不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I don't trust angels, which means I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.62,0:22:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却没给这里施加天使防护咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you haven't warded this place against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望卡西迪奥会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hoping Castiel will return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.26,0:22:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敬重你的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望他也能如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wish he felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.45,0:22:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不愿相信 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't want to believe it, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们是一边的 关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're on the same side … shutting the gates of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让卡西迪奥归群\N{\fnArial\fs30}bringing Castiel in from the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what I've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.21,0:23:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们跟阿杰做了生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been doing business with Ajay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did mention, didn't he,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.19,0:23:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进入地狱的路径要途径炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his way into hell is through purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你会想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.58,0:23:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我们能彼此帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we can be of help to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里有数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where the hell you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back. Get back, get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! We got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 他们在迷惑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, they're messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.97,0:23:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他的 他不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him. He's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.28,0:23:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 离他远点 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby, get away from him! - We got to go now … aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里是知道的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew somehow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.51,0:24:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌了一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.37,0:24:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半一半嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}50/50.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ajay? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.19,0:24:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 别生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't get all pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.55,0:24:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.63,0:24:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.68,0:25:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.88,0:25:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 很久没联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, man. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想打给你 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I wanted to call. I did. I just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.80,0:25:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得还是不打为好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it might be better if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴听到你的声音 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good to hear your voice, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.36,0:25:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.22,0:25:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.84,0:25:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.08,0:25:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.62,0:25:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你失望了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I let you down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.25,0:25:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打来我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just happy as hell to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.80,0:25:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,过会儿你大概就不这么想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might change your mind about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.08,0:25:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 我得求你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, I got to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.13,0:25:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这道测试之后还有几道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how many more of these trials after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.43,0:25:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还不知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know what it is, though … not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文还在翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's still translating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚在地狱里也看到了 我还能活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you saw back there in hell, I ain't got a lot of rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能再次参与行动感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just feels so good to be back in action again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.15,0:26:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我跟在你们身边或许能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be handy if you had me around to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.89,0:26:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 相信我 我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I'd … I'd love that, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.97,0:26:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 要完成测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, for this trial to be completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.14,0:26:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂要进入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}your soul has to enter heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 如果不那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, if that weren't the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都烧了你的尸骨了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}we burned your bones, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地上也没有能承载你灵魂的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to tie your spirit to earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.48,0:26:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.83,0:26:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以为那样就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I always figured that'd be the end of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.05,0:26:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just a hunter's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.42,0:26:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就什么都不剩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.89,0:26:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.26,0:26:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这真是没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.07,0:26:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果非得有永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess if there has to be an eternity,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.08,0:26:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可上天堂也好过下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd pick heaven over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.51,0:26:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为上边就天下太平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. 'cause there's nothing screwy going on up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.79,0:26:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望这我能说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I made the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.35,0:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就做我该做的 了结这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, do my part, get to the end of this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.53,0:26:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是退休的那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't exactly the retiring type,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.37,0:26:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你们两个白痴能让我还魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}so, you idjits figure out a way to spring me…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.29,0:27:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 这没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, of course. That's, uh … yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.45,0:27:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, let's get topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.17,0:27:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里 肯定就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. This is the place. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.77,0:27:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出租车司机应该在这里等你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where your cabbie's supposed to meet you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.35,0:27:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. At exactly…now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he's running a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.76,0:27:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, see, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 他明确说过要一分不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was very specific, Bobby, like, to the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.61,0:27:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he doesn't show…?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没法出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.13,0:27:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不想插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want nothing to do with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.03,0:27:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.07,0:27:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特要帮忙 可不是胡闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Dean Winchester asks for a favor, he's not screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.65,0:27:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 让你去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, sending you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.68,0:27:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最不想做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the last thing I ever wanted to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.34,0:27:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.33,0:27:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我弟弟困在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my little brother is stuck down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个要杀了我的弟弟 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would be the little brother who wants to kill me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.41,0:27:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got access to the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.14,0:27:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说「进去」 是指「身首异处」\N{\fnArial\fs30}By "Access, " You mean "Getting beheaded"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.14,0:28:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你说得对 我要求的太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right … it's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.00,0:28:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我也没为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I've exactly been there for you lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.40,0:28:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.41,0:28:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I love a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.18,0:28:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不欠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't owe me nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.99,0:28:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好可以借此休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a break from all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.34,0:28:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的那么艰辛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really been that tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.30,0:28:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我无法融入群体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a good fit, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和吸血鬼不行 和人类当然更不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with vampires and, for sure, not with the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不属于任何一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.99,0:28:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了一阵后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after a while…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种感觉令人厌烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That starts to wear on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.64,0:28:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.37,0:29:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你需要听我唧唧歪歪似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cry me a river. Like you need to listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you get back up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.25,0:29:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起想办法好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna fix all that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.43,0:29:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你找到传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you find the portal,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.14,0:29:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟萨姆一起离开炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your ride out of purgatory with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.79,0:29:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前我们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you did with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.18,0:29:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一送你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I send you back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.23,0:29:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就立刻赶往缅因州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna haul my ass up to Maine,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们出来时 我就在那里等着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna be waiting there for you when you get topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 这听起来挺靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That sounds like a plan, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.39,0:29:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.36,0:29:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.27,0:29:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是我第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my first rodeo, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.13,0:30:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.78,0:30:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on. You a wimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.32,0:30:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩在这里待了一年吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean spent a year in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.60,0:30:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,边逃边战斗 从早到晚 每一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running and fighting, all day, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been hell on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.57,0:30:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能救他出来 一定很难过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}not being able to get him out all that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.24,0:30:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试着救他了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did try?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 迪恩和我之前说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby, Dean and I had an agreement, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.48,0:30:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我教你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taught you that agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你们不会遵守的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a non-agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我离开后一定发生了许多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the feeling a lot must have happened while I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.48,0:31:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.83,0:31:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 不不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, no, no, wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.06,0:31:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.21,0:31:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩让我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不会是我的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Not my Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是迪恩的朋友 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a buddy of Dean's, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.14,0:31:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.89,0:31:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个该死的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A frigging vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.83,0:31:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走后你俩真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you two really went off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.79,0:31:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都敢做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I was gone, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 听着 我知道你曾在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Benny, listen … I know you saved my brother's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.02,0:32:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,多次救过我哥 我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few times down here, and I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.85,0:32:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我现在是想救你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and now I'm trying to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.42,0:32:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我真是给吸血鬼丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm a disgrace to my own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.80,0:32:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.37,0:32:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们上去的缝隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seam that gets us back up top?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.95,0:32:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.81,0:32:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.30,0:32:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们记得我说的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.42,0:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.63,0:32:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 鲍比 现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Bobby, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上去后 就放你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get to earth and I release you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.97,0:32:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能直入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's an express straight to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time for goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.00,0:32:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经和你道别过一次了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already said goodbye to you once, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.01,0:32:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么了不起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't seem to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今后说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason to think I won't see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.03,0:32:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果上面让我坐安乐椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they give me a rocking chair up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.38,0:32:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会破口大骂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm raising hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.31,0:33:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧 本尼 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on, Benny. It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.69,0:33:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.34,0:33:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.54,0:33:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还和温家兄弟合作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still working with the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.76,0:33:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.73,0:33:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for you to go, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.61,0:33:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.37,0:33:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 他们想要我 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. It's me they want. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要告诉迪恩 我说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just make sure you tell Dean I said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.47,0:33:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那边本来也过不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was never any good up there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.57,0:34:17.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（缅因州 100英里荒地）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.34,0:34:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.07,0:34:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个园艺场 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real garden spot, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.12,0:34:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.36,0:35:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他带出来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.28,0:35:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只带出了鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.70,0:35:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.19,0:35:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,带出鲍比太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's fantastic about Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look … Benny, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.53,0:35:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他带我们出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.96,0:35:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了几个吸血鬼 他把他们引开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of vamps showed, and he used himself as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.07,0:35:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉即使没有吸血鬼来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the feeling that even if that didn't happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.90,0:35:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不想回来 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't want to come back, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.44,0:35:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.83,0:35:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 鲍比 他在那下面还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…Bobby … how … how'd he hold up down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.60,0:35:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于种种情况 他还好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good, all things considered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.24,0:35:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 脾气大得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ornery as hell, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们送那个老人家去他该去的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put that old man where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.90,0:35:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.37,0:36:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.00,0:36:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.69,0:36:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.77,0:36:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.25,0:36:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·辛格 化成烟我也认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer … I'd know you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.95,0:36:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他走 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不属于地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't belong in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.78,0:36:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说是就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does if I say he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.00,0:36:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾给我族类带来无数伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's inflicted untold damage on my kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.71,0:36:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where I sit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.34,0:36:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连下地狱都不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually, hell's too good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.68,0:36:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.52,0:37:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看我对目前情况的理解是否正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I've interpreted the situation correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟从地狱救出了一个无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters have freed an innocent from hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却在阻挠他的升天\N{\fnArial\fs30}to which you are wrongfully trying to return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.15,0:37:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们一伙儿了吗 娜奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siding with them, Naomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.96,0:37:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不了解他们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把我们都关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they're done, we'll both be locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.49,0:37:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我只希望他们把你关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just hoping they lock you away, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的我自有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest I'll figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.21,0:37:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bureaucrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.98,0:37:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是自不量力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fighting outside your weight class.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.39,0:37:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许说我是官僚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me a bureaucrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过你可以信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you you could trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.14,0:38:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会儿告诉你 先完成测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you later. Let's get this trial done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.71,0:38:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.07,0:38:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.84,0:38:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.72,0:38:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.93,0:38:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay! It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.29,0:38:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.98,0:38:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:39:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是玩腻了 不是吗 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tired of this, aren't you, Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.09,0:39:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧 躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear, the hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.30,0:39:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是玩腻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.44,0:39:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是一场梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.19,0:39:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.92,0:39:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.76,0:39:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.92,0:39:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你能躲我一辈子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you could elude me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找不到这个谭 就去找另一个谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can't find one Tran, find another.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.58,0:39:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈不愿透露你的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom, she didn't want to give you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.11,0:39:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真能忍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a pain threshold, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.10,0:39:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她能承受的痛苦也是有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even she could only take so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.74,0:39:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不可能告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never would have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.86,0:39:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当妈的都那样 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moms are like that, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.74,0:39:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她手机里找到了你的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got your address off her smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.54,0:40:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些人永远都不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you people never seem to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.93,0:40:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you are nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只是转瞬即逝的灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleeting blips of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.24,0:40:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.73,0:40:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.77,0:40:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把本尼埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I buried Benny…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.35,0:40:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有烧掉他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I didn't burn his bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟他努力救了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}After he said he'd try to get you out of there,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.09,0:40:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不忍心放弃他\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just didn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.66,0:40:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你瞧不上他 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you got no use for him, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.43,0:40:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我懂 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.13,0:40:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我想的并不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a… He's a little different from what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.82,0:41:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想留着他就留吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, go ahead and leave the door open if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.41,0:41:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 咱们去看看先知小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, let's go check in with prophet boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.43,0:41:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清楚他把石碑藏在了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see where he stashed that tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.12,0:41:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? It's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.20,0:41:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.61,0:41:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.41,0:41:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.53,0:41:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿走了我们所有的东西 他的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took all our stuff, his notes…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.79,0:41:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 他终于还是吓傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw this coming. Finally freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.21,0:41:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小毛孩逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little geek made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.86,0:41:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但他会去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but where?
